OL,3,GNEWSAInjured horse rider backs road
OL,4,Asafety campaign
OL,5,
OL,6,FA rider who suffered internal bleeding
OL,7,Fafter she fell into a ditch with her
OL,8,Fhorse when it was spooked by a van has
OL,9,Furged people to consider their speed on
OL,10,Frural roads.
OL,12,FHannah Green, from Melksham, Wiltshire,
OL,13,Fsaid she had been riding her racehorse,
OL,14,FWinnie, when the vehicle came around a
OL,15,Fcorner "quite fast" leading them to
OL,16,Ffall.
OL,18,FGreen was taken by ambulance to
OL,19,FSouthmead Hospital in Bristol where it
OL,20,Fwas found she had a laceration on her
OL,21,Fliver, a displaced rib fracture and
OL,22,Fhematoma.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
