OL,3,GNEWSAInjured horse rider backs road
OL,4,Asafety campaign
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I've had a few near misses before but
OL,7,Fnothing as bad as this," Green said.
OL,8,F"I've had experiences where cars come
OL,9,Fby fast and she normally just stops and
OL,10,Flet them go. But this time, the van
OL,11,Fcaught her off guard."
